<% content_for :title, "What is this link?" %>
<div class="mx-auto max-w-lg">
  <h1 class="heading text-3xl">What is this link?</h1>
  <p class="mt-4 text-ink-soft">Sherlock charts a tracker member's upload, download and ratio over time. Members who put this link on their tracker profile have asked this Sherlock to track them. It reads only what their profile already shows to other members of the tracker, and shows the charts only to them.</p>
  <p class="mt-3 text-ink-soft">Removing the link from the profile stops the tracking.</p>
  <%= link_to "Learn more about Sherlock", root_path, class: "btn-primary mt-6" %>
</div>
